	"bodyHtml": "<div class=\"d--flex\" style=\"flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n                    \n\n                                        \n                            <div id=\"id-34-73\" class=\"section section__textblock section--none section--padding bg-c--hard-conversion txt-c--nero title-c--nero link-c--nero\">\n      <div class=\"san-container\" data-span=\"full-desktop\">\n                    <div class=\"san-col\" data-span=\"12 desktop-xl-6\">\n        <div class=\"j-content txt--left pb--0 desktop-xl-pb--60\" data-block=\"\" data-type=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"text\">\n          <h1>VOSKES KIBBLE ON THE MENU, THAT TASTES LIKE MORE!</h1>\n\n                </div>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n\n  <div class=\"san-col\" data-span=\"12 desktop-xl-6\">\n          <div class=\"j-content txt--left pt--0 desktop-xl-pt--60\" data-block=\"\" data-type=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"text\">\n          <p><strong>Our delicious, crunchy kibble with lots of chicken or salmon will ensure your cat will eat its bowl with relish!</strong> This balanced premium cat food comes in both for growing kittens and adult cats. Moreover, we have a special recipe for sterilised cats, allowing them to also enjoy tasty food while maintaining their ideal weight.</p>\n\n                </div>\n    </div>\n        </div>\n          </div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                                <div class=\"section section--none section--padding bg-c--white txt-c--nero heading-c--nero link-c--nero\">\n    <div class=\"san-container\"><div class=\"san-col\"><div class=\"glide\" data-js-slide=\"\" id=\"card-carousel--1786860823\" data-autoplay=\"5000\" data-peek-after=\"0\" data-peek-before=\"0\" data-break=\"85,48\" data-per-view=\"4,2,1\"><div class=\"glide__track\" data-glide-el=\"track\"><ul class=\"glide__slides\" style=\"padding: 5px 0;\"><li class=\"glide__slide ps--15\">  <div class=\"j-card bg-c--transparent txt-c--nero\" data-type=\"container\" data-lazyload=\"true\" data-background-image=\"/uploads/bg_image/bg_image-kitten_complete_chicken_–_1b1-background_image-48-50.png\" style=\"background-size: contain;\">\n    <div class=\"j-card\" data-type=\"head\" data-no-border=\"\" data-no-padding=\"\">\n\n                  <div class=\"ar ar--square\">\n            <div class=\"ar__content\">\n\n                \n            </div>\n          </div>\n        \n    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"j-card\" data-type=\"body\">\n            <div class=\"j-card txt--center\" data-type=\"title\">Kitten Complete Chicken</div>\n            <div class=\"j-card\" data-type=\"content\"></div>\n    </div>\n    \n        </div>\n    </li><li class=\"glide__slide ps--15\">  <div class=\"j-card bg-c--transparent txt-c--nero\" data-type=\"container\" data-lazyload=\"true\" data-background-image=\"/uploads/bg_image/bg_image-adult_complete_chicken_–_14-background_image-48-49.png\" style=\"background-size: contain;\">\n    <div class=\"j-card\" data-type=\"head\" data-no-border=\"\" data-no-padding=\"\">\n\n                  <div class=\"ar ar--square\">\n            <div class=\"ar__content\">\n\n                \n            </div>\n          </div>\n        \n    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"j-card\" data-type=\"body\">\n            <div class=\"j-card txt--center\" data-type=\"title\">Adult Complete Chicken</div>\n            <div class=\"j-card\" data-type=\"content\"></div>\n    </div>\n    \n        </div>\n    </li><li class=\"glide__slide ps--15\">  <div class=\"j-card bg-c--transparent txt-c--nero\" data-type=\"container\" data-lazyload=\"true\" data-background-image=\"/uploads/bg_image/bg_image-adult_complete_salmon_–_13-background_image-48-48.png\" style=\"background-size: contain;\">\n    <div class=\"j-card\" data-type=\"head\" data-no-border=\"\" data-no-padding=\"\">\n\n                  <div class=\"ar ar--square\">\n            <div class=\"ar__content\">\n\n                \n            </div>\n          </div>\n        \n    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"j-card\" data-type=\"body\">\n            <div class=\"j-card txt--center\" data-type=\"title\">Adult Complete Salmon</div>\n            <div class=\"j-card\" data-type=\"content\"></div>\n    </div>\n    \n        </div>\n    </li><li class=\"glide__slide ps--15\">  <div class=\"j-card bg-c--transparent txt-c--nero\" data-type=\"container\" data-lazyload=\"true\" data-background-image=\"/uploads/bg_image/bg_image-adult_sterilized_chicken_–_13-background_image-48-51.png\" style=\"background-size: contain;\">\n    <div class=\"j-card\" data-type=\"head\" data-no-border=\"\" data-no-padding=\"\">\n\n                  <div class=\"ar ar--square\">\n            <div class=\"ar__content\">\n\n                \n            </div>\n          </div>\n        \n    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"j-card\" data-type=\"body\">\n            <div class=\"j-card txt--center\" data-type=\"title\">Adult Sterilized Chicken</div>\n            <div class=\"j-card\" data-type=\"content\"></div>\n    </div>\n    \n        </div>\n    </li><li class=\"glide__slide ps--15\">  <div class=\"j-card bg-c--transparent txt-c--nero\" data-type=\"container\" data-lazyload=\"true\" data-background-image=\"/uploads/bg_image/bg_image-adult_sterilized_salmon_–_13-background_image-48-52.png\" style=\"background-size: contain;\">\n    <div class=\"j-card\" data-type=\"head\" data-no-border=\"\" data-no-padding=\"\">\n\n                  <div class=\"ar ar--square\">\n            <div class=\"ar__content\">\n\n                \n            </div>\n          </div>\n        \n    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"j-card\" data-type=\"body\">\n            <div class=\"j-card txt--center\" data-type=\"title\">Adult Sterilized Salmon</div>\n            <div class=\"j-card\" data-type=\"content\"></div>\n    </div>\n    \n        </div>\n    </li></ul></div><div class=\"card__carousel-controls\" data-glide-el=\"controls\"><button class=\"card__carousel-control txt--nero\" data-glide-dir=\"<\" aria-label=\"قبلی\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"fas fa-long-arrow-alt-right\"></i></button><button class=\"card__carousel-control txt--nero\" data-glide-dir=\">\" aria-label=\"بعدی\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"fas fa-long-arrow-alt-left\"></i></button></div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n            \n            \n                              \n\n<div id=\"id-38-34\" class=\"highlight section section--none txt-c--nero bg-c--transparent title-c--cat-primary link-c--nero link-hc--nero\">\n    <div class=\"san-container p--0\" data-span=\"full\" data-options=\"\" data-no-gap=\"\"><div class=\"san-col highlight__media highlight__media--half\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-2\"><div class=\"ar-tablet-lg--4by3 ar--4by3 ar\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><div class=\"highlight__single-image ar__content\">\n      <img src=\"/uploads/landscape/landscape-brokken1-images-38-34.png\" alt=\"MORE MEAT, LESS CARBS...\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"obj--cover\">\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"san-col pv--15 tablet-lg-pv--0\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-1\" data-options=\"extra-padding--tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-container ps--0 mobile-lg-ps--15 tablet-lg-ps--0 h-100\" data-span=\"full-tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-col tablet-lg-ps--0\"><div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"container\" data-centered=\"\" data-block=\"\"><div class=\"j-content txt--left\" data-type=\"text\"><h3>MORE MEAT, LESS CARBS...</h3><p>Your furry friend's natural menu is low in carbohydrates. This is because your cat's digestive system lacks the ability to easily digest lots of carbohydrates. Cat food with <strong>meat or fish as the main ingredient</strong> is therefore the optimal choice, both in terms of taste and health for your four-legged friend.</p><h3>... SO MORE PROTEIN</h3><p>Besides being packed with flavour and <strong>high in protein</strong>, meat contains a number of essential amino acids (proteins) such as <strong>taurine and arginine.</strong> 'Essential' means that cats must get these amino acids through their diet, as their bodies cannot produce them on their own. For instance, taurine is <strong>crucial for eyesight</strong> and <strong>heart health</strong>. Chicken, salmon and other fish: they are all useful, appetising - and <em>paw-sitive</em>! - sources of protein!</p></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n            \n            \n                                \n  \n<div id=\"id-38-35\" class=\"highlight section section--none txt-c--nero bg-c--white title-c--beef link-c--nero link-hc--nero\">\n    <div class=\"san-container p--0\" data-span=\"full\" data-options=\"\" data-no-gap=\"\"><div class=\"san-col highlight__media highlight__media--half\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\"><div class=\"ar-tablet-lg--2by1 ar--2by1 ar\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><div class=\"highlight__single-image ar__content\">\n      <img src=\"/uploads/original/gezond_gebit_visual_3.webp\" alt=\"HEALTHY TEETH for cats\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"obj--cover\">\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"san-col pv--15 tablet-lg-pv--0\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\"><div class=\"san-container ps--0 mobile-lg-ps--15 tablet-lg-ps--0 h-100\" data-span=\"full-tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-col tablet-lg-ps--0\"><div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"container\" data-centered=\"\" data-block=\"\"><div class=\"j-content txt--left\" data-type=\"text\"><h3>HEALTHY TEETH</h3><p>Obviously, the big advantage of kibble is the 'tooth brushing' function of a crunchy bite. Voskes adds something else: <strong>phosphorylated vitamin C</strong>! Clinical studies show that <strong>the formation of plaque and tartar is drastically reduced</strong> by the special addition of phosphorylated vitamin C. In this way, you can be sure that the full benefit of dry food is achieved.</p></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n                            <div id=\"id-34-80\" class=\"section section__textblock section--none section--padding bg-c--hard-conversion txt-c--nero title-c--nero link-c--nero\">\n      <div class=\"san-container\">\n                    <div class=\"san-col\">\n        <div class=\"j-content txt--center pb--0 desktop-xl-pb--60\" data-type=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"text\">\n          <h1>DELICIOUS, CRUNCHY KIBBLE FOR EVERY CAT</h1>\n\n                </div>\n    </div>\n                </div>\n\n          </div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n            \n            \n                              \n\n<div id=\"id-38-36\" class=\"highlight section section--none txt-c--nero bg-c--transparent title-c--shrimp link-c--nero link-hc--nero\">\n    <div class=\"san-container p--0\" data-span=\"full\" data-options=\"\" data-no-gap=\"\"><div class=\"san-col highlight__media highlight__media--half\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-2\"><div class=\"ar-tablet-lg--4by3 ar--4by3 ar\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><div class=\"highlight__single-image ar__content\">\n      <img src=\"/uploads/landscape/landscape-speelse_ravotters-_kittens_tot_1_jaar1-images-38-36.jpg\" alt=\"PLAYFUL ROMPERS: KITTENS UP TO 1 YEAR\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"obj--cover\">\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"san-col pv--15 tablet-lg-pv--0\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-1\" data-options=\"extra-padding--tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-container ps--0 mobile-lg-ps--15 tablet-lg-ps--0 h-100\" data-span=\"full-tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-col tablet-lg-ps--0\"><div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"container\" data-centered=\"\" data-block=\"\"><div class=\"j-content txt--left\" data-type=\"text\"><h3>PLAYFUL ROMPERS: KITTENS UP TO 1 YEAR</h3><p>Our Kitten Complete Chicken is a <strong>meaty kibble</strong>, providing the much-needed protein your kitten needs to <strong>support rapid growth.</strong> This kitten food is enriched with <strong>prebiotics, beta-glucans and dietary fibre</strong> for the development of healthy intestinal flora. The energy-rich food also ensures a <strong>strong immune system</strong>, thanks to its <strong>high vitamin and mineral content</strong> and a mix of dried plant extracts, <strong>rich in antioxidants.</strong></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\" src=\"https://sanux.100.nl/uploads/voskes.nl/v2/original/kittens_icons_en.png\" alt=\"PLAYFUL ROMPERS: KITTENS UP TO 1 YEAR\"></p><a href=\"/en/products/kitten-complete-chicken.html\" class=\"btn mt--15 btn--nero btn--normal\">مشاهده محصول</a></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n            \n            \n                              \n\n<div id=\"id-38-37\" class=\"highlight section section--none txt-c--nero bg-c--transparent title-c--shrimp link-c--nero link-hc--nero\">\n    <div class=\"san-container p--0\" data-span=\"full\" data-options=\"\" data-no-gap=\"\"><div class=\"san-col highlight__media highlight__media--half\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\"><div class=\"ar-tablet-lg--4by3 ar--4by3 ar\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><div class=\"highlight__single-image ar__content\">\n      <img src=\"/uploads/landscape/landscape-ondernemende_katten_vanaf_1_jaar1-images-38-37.jpg\" alt=\"ENTERPRISING CATS FROM 1 YEAR OF AGE\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"obj--cover\">\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"san-col pv--15 tablet-lg-pv--0\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\"><div class=\"san-container ps--0 mobile-lg-ps--15 tablet-lg-ps--0 h-100\" data-span=\"full-tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-col tablet-lg-ps--0\"><div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"container\" data-centered=\"\" data-block=\"\"><div class=\"j-content txt--left\" data-type=\"text\"><h3>ENTERPRISING CATS FROM 1 YEAR OF AGE</h3><p>Our Adult Complete contains chicken or salmon as the main ingredient to combine flavour and protein quality. The easily digestible kibble also contains prebiotics and antioxidants to support healthy gut flora and strong immunity. The vegetable fibre and beet pulp help swallowed hair pass better through the digestive tract so there is less risk of hairballs. Finally, the amount of minerals plays a role in promoting good pH levels and thus contributing to healthy urinary tracts. Talk about cat-tastic news!<br>&nbsp;<br><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\" src=\"https://sanux.100.nl/uploads/voskes.nl/v2/original/adult_icons_en.png\" alt=\"ENTERPRISING CATS FROM 1 YEAR OF AGE\"></p><a href=\"/en/cat-food/complete-dry-food.html\" class=\"btn mt--15 btn--nero btn--normal\">Discover all flavours</a></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n            \n            \n                              \n\n<div id=\"id-38-38\" class=\"highlight section section--none txt-c--nero bg-c--white title-c--shrimp link-c--nero link-hc--nero\">\n    <div class=\"san-container p--0\" data-span=\"full\" data-options=\"\" data-no-gap=\"\"><div class=\"san-col highlight__media highlight__media--half\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-2\"><div class=\"ar-tablet-lg--4by3 ar--4by3 ar\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><div class=\"highlight__single-image ar__content\">\n      <img src=\"/uploads/landscape/landscape-gesteriliseerde_en_gecastreerde_katten1-images-38-38.jpg\" alt=\"SPAYED AND NEUTERED CATS\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"obj--cover\">\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"san-col pv--15 tablet-lg-pv--0\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-1\" data-options=\"extra-padding--tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-container ps--0 mobile-lg-ps--15 tablet-lg-ps--0 h-100\" data-span=\"full-tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-col tablet-lg-ps--0\"><div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"container\" data-centered=\"\" data-block=\"\"><div class=\"j-content txt--left\" data-type=\"text\"><h3>SPAYED AND NEUTERED CATS</h3><p>Our Adult Sterilised rich in chicken or salmon contains some additional pluses in addition to all the benefits that Adult Complete contains. The Adult Sterilised contains less fat, and therefore fewer calories. Psyllium and beet pulp also provide a much greater sense of satiety and help reduce the formation of hairballs. Fat burning is boosted by the addition of the amino acid L-carnitine. Pawesome!</p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\" src=\"https://sanux.100.nl/uploads/voskes.nl/v2/original/gesteriliseerd_icons_en.png\" alt=\"SPAYED AND NEUTERED CATS\"></p><a href=\"/en/cat-food/complete-dry-food.html\" class=\"btn mt--15 btn--nero btn--normal\">همه طعم‌ها را ببینید</a></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n            \n            \n                              \n\n<div id=\"id-38-39\" class=\"highlight section section--none txt-c--nero bg-c--transparent title-c--cat-primary link-c--nero link-hc--nero\">\n    <div class=\"san-container p--0\" data-span=\"full\" data-options=\"\" data-no-gap=\"\"><div class=\"san-col highlight__media highlight__media--half\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\"><div class=\"ar-tablet-lg--4by3 ar--4by3 ar\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><div class=\"highlight__single-image ar__content\">\n      <img src=\"/uploads/landscape/landscape-landscape-istock-1226324229-images-8-64-images-38-39.jpg\" alt=\"VOSKES CAT FOOD\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"obj--cover\">\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"san-col pv--15 tablet-lg-pv--0\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\"><div class=\"san-container ps--0 mobile-lg-ps--15 tablet-lg-ps--0 h-100\" data-span=\"full-tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-col tablet-lg-ps--0\"><div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"container\" data-centered=\"\" data-block=\"\"><div class=\"j-content txt--left\" data-type=\"text\"><h2>WHY YOUR LITTLE TIGER CHOOSES VOSKES CAT FOOD</h2><p>Apart from all the specific healthy ingredients added per life stage, there are even more paw-some reasons why more and more little tigers are fans of Voskes dry food.</p><ul><li><strong>Super tastyyyyyy</strong></li><li><strong>Available in 2kg and 7kg</strong></li><li><strong>Packaging is resealable and recyclable</strong></li><li><strong>Meat and fish as main ingredient</strong></li><li><strong>High share of animal proteins</strong></li><li><strong>Free of gluten, wheat and maize</strong></li></ul></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            </div>"
}
